                <head>Papers relating to the Treaty of Washington.</head>
                <p rendition="#center">Volume V.—Berlin arbitration.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">Containing the memorial of the United States on the Canal de
                    Haro as its boundary-line; case of the government of Her Britannic Majesty;
                    reply of the United States thereto; second and definitive statement of the
                    government of Her Britannic Majesty; and correspondence.</p>
